  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Drinking alone in Susukino, Sapporo's lively entertainment district, the protagonist witnesses a loud argument over twenty thousand yen. After the bar's owner restores order, a young hustler sits down beside him to thank him and pour a drink. Listen to their first meeting.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "何を返すんだよ？二万？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "mama",
      "t": "二人ともやめなさい！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "mama",
      "t": "次に騒ぎを起こしたら、トシちゃん、追い出すからね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "分かってるよ、ママ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "悪かったって。ママ、今日も美しいね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "mama",
      "t": "あんたもね。はいはい。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "俺はトシだ。助かったよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "まあ、一杯やってくれよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "いや、もう十分だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "そんな冷たいこと言うなよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "さあ、グラスを持ってきて。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "じゃあ、少しだけいただくよ。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Bar banter moves fast—from stern scolding to shameless flattery to pouring drinks. Let's unpack each expression.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "何を返すんだよ？二万？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Give back what? Twenty thousand yen?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "mama",
      "t": "二人ともやめなさい！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Both of you, stop it right now!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "mama",
      "t": "次に騒ぎを起こしたら、トシちゃん、追い出すからね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Cause a commotion next time, Toshi-chan, and I will throw you out.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "ママ、今日も美しいね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mama, you look beautiful today too.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "mama",
      "t": "あんたもね。はいはい。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You too, sure, sure.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "助かったよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You really helped me out.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "まあ、一杯やってくれよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Come on, let me pour you a drink.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "いや、もう十分だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No, I have had plenty already.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "そんな冷たいこと言うなよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do not say something so cold.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "さあ、グラスを持ってきて。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Come on, bring a glass over here.'",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
